Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When a patient
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,comes in with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.92,0:00:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,an MRI,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.36,0:00:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,put it down,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.68,0:00:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and they look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.10,0:00:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,to look at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the MRI?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.28,0:00:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not concerned
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,with the MRI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,scan shows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,at this point
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I tell people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.40,0:00:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,all the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,and I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.22,0:00:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,repeated this,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I do the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.16,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.80,0:00:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.08,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,not do
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.30,0:00:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,treatment on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.20,0:00:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,an MRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.71,0:00:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They do not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,do surgery on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,an MRI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.15,0:00:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes you see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.87,0:00:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,a person,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.27,0:00:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,they have full
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,thickness tears of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the rotator cuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.95,0:00:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and they lift
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.65,0:00:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,their arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.19,0:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:27.49,Default,,0,0,0,,They have pain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and some instability,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.51,0:00:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,and other people
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.05,0:00:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,have that small
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,little tear,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,and they can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.67,0:00:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.01,0:00:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,rehabable.
